<hr/>

<h2>1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY</h2>

<p>GarmentsERP is a comprehensive, enterprise-grade, web-based ERP system designed specifically for the garments and apparel manufacturing industry. The system digitizes and automates all operational processes — from raw material procurement through the complete production lifecycle to final shipment, payroll, and financial accounting.</p>

<p>The application supports multiple users with distinct roles and permissions, provides a responsive interface across all device types (desktop, tablet, mobile), generates professional PDF reports via QuestPDF, and is built on a modern technology stack:</p>
<ul><li>**Backend:** ASP.NET Core 10 (Modular Monolithic + CQRS)</li></ul>
<ul><li>**Frontend:** Next.js 14 (App Router, TypeScript)</li></ul>
<ul><li>**Database:** Microsoft SQL Server 2022</li></ul>
<ul><li>**Reports:** QuestPDF</li></ul>

<p><strong>Key Business Value:</strong></p>
<ul><li>Eliminate paper-based processes across all factory departments</li></ul>
<ul><li>Achieve real-time visibility into production, stock, and finances</li></ul>
<ul><li>Enforce accountability with role-based access control</li></ul>
<ul><li>Reduce wastage through data-driven decisions</li></ul>
<ul><li>Accelerate buyer reporting with automated PDF generation</li></ul>

<hr/>

<h2>2. BUSINESS BACKGROUND & PROBLEM STATEMENT</h2>

<h3>2.1 Business Background</h3>

<p>The garments industry involves a complex, multi-department operational flow:</p>
<ul><li>Raw material procurement from domestic/international suppliers</li></ul>
<ul><li>Thread, yarn, and accessory management</li></ul>
<ul><li>Production floor operations (cutting, sewing, washing, finishing)</li></ul>
<ul><li>Quality control at multiple checkpoints</li></ul>
<ul><li>HR, payroll, and attendance management</li></ul>
<ul><li>Financial accounting and reporting</li></ul>
<ul><li>Buyer order management and shipment tracking</li></ul>

<h3>2.2 Current Problems</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Problem</th><th>Business Impact</th></tr>
<tr><td>No centralized data system</td><td>Data silos, inconsistent records</td></tr>
<tr><td>Manual stock tracking</td><td>Overstocking, stockouts, material wastage</td></tr>
<tr><td>No production visibility</td><td>Missed delivery dates, poor buyer relations</td></tr>
<tr><td>Paper-based attendance & payroll</td><td>Errors, fraud, slow processing</td></tr>
<tr><td>No integrated accounting</td><td>Inaccurate P&L, delayed financial decisions</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lack of QC tracking</td><td>High defect rate, buyer rejections</td></tr>
<tr><td>No real-time dashboards</td><td>Management blind spots</td></tr>
<tr><td>No audit trails</td><td>Accountability issues, compliance failures</td></tr>
</table>

<hr/>

<h2>3. PROJECT OBJECTIVES & GOALS</h2>

<h3>3.1 Primary Objectives</h3>

<ol><li>Build a single, unified ERP platform covering all factory operations</li></ol>
<ol><li>Implement a secure, role-based multi-user access system</li></ol>
<ol><li>Digitize the complete garments production lifecycle</li></ol>
<ol><li>Provide real-time inventory and stock management</li></ol>
<ol><li>Automate payroll calculation and HR operations</li></ol>
<ol><li>Deliver a complete double-entry accounting module</li></ol>
<ol><li>Generate professional PDF reports for all business documents</li></ol>
<ol><li>Provide actionable KPI dashboards for management</li></ol>

<h3>3.2 SMART Goals</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Goal</th><th>Target</th></tr>
<tr><td>Reduce manual data entry time</td><td>By 80% within 3 months of go-live</td></tr>
<tr><td>Achieve real-time stock accuracy</td><td>99%+ accuracy vs physical count</td></tr>
<tr><td>Reduce payroll processing time</td><td>From 3 days to 4 hours per month</td></tr>
<tr><td>QC defect tracking</td><td>100% digital, zero paper records</td></tr>
<tr><td>Report generation time</td><td>Under 5 seconds for any PDF report</td></tr>
<tr><td>System availability</td><td>99.5% uptime during business hours</td></tr>
</table>

<hr/>

<h2>4. PROJECT SCOPE</h2>

<h3>4.1 In Scope</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Area</th><th>Included Features</th></tr>
<tr><td>Authentication</td><td>Login, logout, JWT, refresh tokens, password reset</td></tr>
<tr><td>User & Role Management</td><td>Multi-user, role-based permissions per module</td></tr>
<tr><td>Procurement</td><td>Supplier management, PO, GRN, invoice matching</td></tr>
<tr><td>Inventory</td><td>Multi-warehouse stock, movements, alerts</td></tr>
<tr><td>Thread/Yarn</td><td>Thread-specific procurement and issue tracking</td></tr>
<tr><td>Production</td><td>Cutting, sewing, washing, finishing, QC</td></tr>
<tr><td>Buyer Orders</td><td>Order management, BOM, delivery schedule</td></tr>
<tr><td>HR & Payroll</td><td>Employee management, attendance, leave, payroll</td></tr>
<tr><td>Finance</td><td>Full double-entry accounting, ledger, financial statements</td></tr>
<tr><td>Reports</td><td>QuestPDF-based PDF for all major documents</td></tr>
<tr><td>Dashboard</td><td>KPI cards, trend charts, department summaries</td></tr>
<tr><td>Audit Logs</td><td>All data changes tracked</td></tr>
<tr><td>Notifications</td><td>In-app alerts for critical events</td></tr>
<tr><td>Responsive UI</td><td>Works on desktop, tablet, and mobile</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>4.2 Out of Scope (Version 1.0)</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Feature</th><th>Reason</th></tr>
<tr><td>Mobile native app (iOS/Android)</td><td>Future phase (PWA covers mobile needs)</td></tr>
<tr><td>AI/ML demand forecasting</td><td>Future enhancement</td></tr>
<tr><td>Multi-currency accounting</td><td>Future phase (single currency v1)</td></tr>
<tr><td>E-commerce integration</td><td>Out of current business scope</td></tr>
<tr><td>IoT machine integration</td><td>Future enhancement</td></tr>
<tr><td>ERP integration (SAP/Oracle)</td><td>Not required currently</td></tr>
</table>

