<hr/>

<h2>6. BUSINESS ASSUMPTIONS & CONSTRAINTS</h2>

<h3>6.1 Assumptions</h3>

<ol><li>Factory has stable internet connection for web application access</li></ol>
<ol><li>Users have modern browsers (Chrome, Edge, Firefox)</li></ol>
<ol><li>Microsoft SQL Server 2022 license will be procured</li></ol>
<ol><li>Windows Server available for hosting backend API</li></ol>
<ol><li>All departments will participate in UAT</li></ol>
<ol><li>Data migration from Excel/manual records handled separately</li></ol>
<ol><li>Training provided to all end users before go-live</li></ol>
<ol><li>Single currency (BDT) for version 1.0</li></ol>

<h3>6.2 Constraints</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Constraint</th><th>Detail</th></tr>
<tr><td>Technology</td><td>Must use ASP.NET Core 10, Next.js 14, MSSQL</td></tr>
<tr><td>Report Library</td><td>Must use QuestPDF only</td></tr>
<tr><td>Architecture</td><td>Modular Monolithic + CQRS mandatory</td></tr>
<tr><td>Timeline</td><td>18 weeks (6 phases)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Responsive Design</td><td>Must work on all device sizes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Security</td><td>JWT authentication is mandatory</td></tr>
</table>


<hr/>

<h2>7. USER ROLES & PERMISSION MATRIX</h2>

<h3>7.1 Role Definitions</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Role</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td>Super Admin</td><td>Full system control, company/tenant management</td></tr>
<tr><td>Admin</td><td>Full access within own company, manages users</td></tr>
<tr><td>Accounts Manager</td><td>Full access to Finance and Accounting module</td></tr>
<tr><td>Store Manager</td><td>Full access to Procurement and Inventory modules</td></tr>
<tr><td>Production Manager</td><td>Full access to all Production department modules</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cutting Supervisor</td><td>Access to Cutting Department module only</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sewing Supervisor</td><td>Access to Sewing Department module only</td></tr>
<tr><td>QC Supervisor</td><td>Access to QC module only</td></tr>
<tr><td>HR Manager</td><td>Full access to HR, Attendance, Leave, and Payroll</td></tr>
<tr><td>Dispatch Officer</td><td>Access to Packing and Dispatch module</td></tr>
<tr><td>Viewer / Auditor</td><td>Read-only access to assigned modules</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>7.2 Permission Types</h3>
<ul><li>**C** = Create  </li></ul>
<ul><li>**R** = Read  </li></ul>
<ul><li>**U** = Update  </li></ul>
<ul><li>**D** = Delete  </li></ul>
<ul><li>**E** = Export PDF  </li></ul>

