<h2>8. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS — ALL MODULES</h2>

<hr/>

<h3>MODULE 8.01: AUTH & USER MANAGEMENT</h3>

<p><strong>Business Purpose:</strong> Secure access control for all system users.</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
<tr><td>AU-001</td><td>Users log in with username/email + password</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-002</td><td>Issue JWT access token (15-minute expiry) on successful login</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-003</td><td>Issue refresh token (7-day expiry) for session continuity</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-004</td><td>Refresh tokens revoked on logout</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-005</td><td>Forgot password via email OTP/link</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-006</td><td>Password complexity: min 8 chars, uppercase, lowercase, number</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-007</td><td>Account lockout after 5 failed attempts (30 min lockout)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-008</td><td>Admin can create, edit, activate, and deactivate user accounts</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-009</td><td>User profile: name, email, phone, avatar, department</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-010</td><td>Each user must belong to at least one role</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-011</td><td>All login/logout events logged with IP address and timestamp</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>AU-012</td><td>"Remember Me" option for extended session</td><td>Medium</td></tr>
</table>

<p><strong>Business Rules:</strong></p>
<ul><li>Deactivated users cannot log in</li></ul>
<ul><li>Super Admin accounts cannot be deactivated by any other user</li></ul>
<ul><li>Password change enforced every 90 days (configurable)</li></ul>

<hr/>

<h3>MODULE 8.02: ROLE & PERMISSION MANAGEMENT</h3>

<p><strong>Business Purpose:</strong> Fine-grained, module-level access control.</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
<tr><td>RP-001</td><td>Admin can create and name custom roles</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-002</td><td>Permissions defined per module: Create, Read, Update, Delete, Export</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-003</td><td>Admin can assign/revoke permissions to roles</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-004</td><td>Admin can assign one or more roles to each user</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-005</td><td>Frontend sidebar dynamically renders only permitted modules</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-006</td><td>Each page/action validates permission before rendering</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-007</td><td>System-default roles cannot be deleted</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-008</td><td>Permission changes take effect on next login or token refresh</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>RP-009</td><td>Admin can clone an existing role as a starting template</td><td>Medium</td></tr>
</table>

<hr/>

<h3>MODULE 8.03: ORGANIZATION / COMPANY SETUP</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
<tr><td>CO-001</td><td>Admin configures company name, logo, address, contact details</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CO-002</td><td>Financial year start and end date configuration</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CO-003</td><td>Currency and default unit of measure setup</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>CO-004</td><td>Create and manage departments</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CO-005</td><td>Create designations/job titles</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>CO-006</td><td>Company logo appears on all generated PDF reports</td><td>High</td></tr>
</table>

<hr/>

<h3>MODULE 8.04: SUPPLIER MANAGEMENT</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
<tr><td>SM-001</td><td>Create supplier profiles</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-002</td><td>Profile includes: name, code, type, address, contact, trade license</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-003</td><td>Categorize suppliers (fabric, thread, accessories, packaging)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-004</td><td>Store supplier bank details for payment processing</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-005</td><td>Track supplier outstanding balance in real time</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-006</td><td>Show complete purchase history per supplier</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-007</td><td>Support supplier deactivation (soft delete only)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-008</td><td>Search suppliers by name, code, category</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SM-009</td><td>Generate supplier statement report (QuestPDF)</td><td>Medium</td></tr>
</table>

<hr/>

<h3>MODULE 8.05: MATERIAL PROCUREMENT (PO / GRN / INVOICE)</h3>

<p><strong>Business Process Flow:</strong></p>
<pre><code>
Purchase Requisition -&gt; Purchase Order -&gt; Approval -&gt; GRN -&gt; Supplier Invoice -&gt; Payment
</code></pre>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
<tr><td>PR-001</td><td>Create Purchase Requisitions</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-002</td><td>POs created referencing a requisition or standalone</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-003</td><td>PO includes: supplier, date, delivery date, items (material, qty, unit, rate)</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-004</td><td>PO supports multi-item, multi-unit entries</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-005</td><td>PO goes through configurable approval workflow</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-006</td><td>Auto-generate PO number (e.g., PO-2026-0001)</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-007</td><td>GRN created against an approved PO</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-008</td><td>GRN supports partial delivery (multiple GRNs per PO)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-009</td><td>GRN creation automatically updates stock in Inventory module</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-010</td><td>Supplier Invoice matched against GRN (3-way matching)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-011</td><td>PO status tracking: Draft, Pending Approval, Approved, Partial, Closed</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>PR-012</td><td>Generate Purchase Order report (QuestPDF)</td><td>High</td></tr>
