<h3>MODULE 8.10: CUTTING DEPARTMENT</h3>

<p><strong>Process Flow:</strong></p>
<pre><code>
Order -&gt; Fabric Requisition -&gt; Marker Plan -&gt; Lay Plan -&gt; Cutting -&gt; Bundle Card -&gt; Issue to Sewing
</code></pre>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
<tr><td>CD-001</td><td>Create Cutting Orders per production plan</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-002</td><td>Cutting Order: style, color, size ratio, fabric details</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-003</td><td>Record fabric requisition and issue from store</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-004</td><td>Marker Plan entry (panel count, size ratio)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-005</td><td>Lay Plan entry (ply count, lay length, fabric required)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-006</td><td>Auto-calculate fabric consumption from lay plan</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-007</td><td>Record actual cut quantity per size per color</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-008</td><td>Track cutting wastage (end bits, splice loss)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-009</td><td>Generate Bundle Cards (bundle ID, size, quantity, destination line)</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-010</td><td>Track each bundle from creation to dispatch to sewing</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>CD-011</td><td>Generate Cutting Order Sheet report (QuestPDF)</td><td>High</td></tr>
</table>

