<h3>MODULE 8.11: SEWING / STITCHING DEPARTMENT</h3>

<p><strong>Process Flow:</strong></p>
<pre><code>
Bundle from Cutting -&gt; Line Assignment -&gt; Daily Target -&gt; Hourly Output Entry -&gt; WIP Tracking -&gt; Complete
</code></pre>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
<tr><td>SD-001</td><td>Line Plan creation per order (lines, operators, target)</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>SD-002</td><td>Supervisor enters hourly/daily actual output per line</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>SD-003</td><td>Calculate efficiency: (Actual / Target) x 100%</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>SD-004</td><td>Track WIP (Work-in-Progress) per bundle and per line</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SD-005</td><td>Log machine downtime with reason codes</td><td>Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td>SD-006</td><td>Track thread and accessory consumption per order</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SD-007</td><td>Generate Sewing Production Report (QuestPDF)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>SD-008</td><td>Operator-wise efficiency summary</td><td>Medium</td></tr>
</table>

