<h3>MODULE 8.13: QUALITY CONTROL (QC)</h3>

<p><strong>QC Checkpoints:</strong></p>
<ol><li>Inline QC — During sewing (per hour/per bundle)</li></ol>
<ol><li>End-Line QC — After sewing is complete</li></ol>
<ol><li>Final Inspection — Before packing (AQL-based)</li></ol>

<table>
<tr><th>Req ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Priority</th></tr>
