<tr><td>QC-004</td><td>Record defects with defect type and location on garment</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>QC-005</td><td>Calculate defect rate: (Defects / Inspected) x 100%</td><td>Critical</td></tr>
<tr><td>QC-006</td><td>AQL (Acceptance Quality Limit) sampling table support</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>QC-007</td><td>Track re-inspection results after alteration/repair</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>QC-008</td><td>Generate QC Inspection Report (QuestPDF)</td><td>High</td></tr>
<tr><td>QC-009</td><td>QC pass/fail trend shown on dashboard</td><td>High</td></tr>
</table>

